TRANSFORMATION RULES,,,,,,
,,,,,,
Output Field,Source Field(s),Transformation Rule,,,
ClaimID,"DateOfService, Sequence","Concatenate ""CLM"" + DateOfService + SequenceNumber",,,
ProcessingDate,DateOfService,Format as YYYY-MM-DD,,,
PayerID,"BIN, PCN",Concatenate BIN + PCN,,,
MemberNumber,MemberID,Direct copy,,,
PatientName,"PatientLastName, PatientFirstName","Concatenate LASTNAME + "", "" + FIRSTNAME (uppercase)",,,
PatientDOB,DateOfBirth,Format CCYYMMDD to YYYY-MM-DD,,,
PharmacyNPI,PharmacyNPI,Direct copy,,,
PharmacyName,PharmacyName,Convert to uppercase,,,
PrescriberNPI,PrescriberNPI,Direct copy,,,
PrescriberName,"PrescriberLastName, PrescriberFirstName","Concatenate LASTNAME + "", "" + FIRSTNAME + "" MD""",,,
RxNumber,RxNumber,Direct copy,,,
NDCCode,NDC,Direct copy,,,
DrugDescription,"DrugName, DrugStrength, DosageForm",Concatenate with space separator,,,
Quantity,QuantityDispensed,Direct copy,,,
DaysSupply,DaysSupply,Direct copy,,,
IngredientCost,IngredientCostSubmitted,Already in cents format,,,
DispensingFee,DispensingFeeSubmitted,Already in cents format,,,
Copay,PatientPaidAmount,Already in cents format,,,
PlanPaidAmount,"GrossAmountDue, PatientPaidAmount",GrossAmountDue - PatientPaidAmount,,,
TotalAmountPaid,GrossAmountDue,Direct copy,,,
ClaimStatus,N/A,Set to PAID if processed successfully,,,
PARequired,PriorAuthTypeCode,"If ""01"" then ""Y"" else ""N""",,,
PANumber,PriorAuthNumber,Copy if PARequired = Y,,,
